Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 16:42:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 81/91] Defender missiles

- A launcher loaded with defenders runs without a target. Each cycle it fires
  one defender at the nearest missile coming at your ship that none of your
  defenders is already chasing. With nothing incoming it doesn't fire and
  uses no charge.
- A missile destroyed in flight now goes away without hitting. Before, a
  missile killed by an npc's defender showed its explosion and still flew on
  and did full damage. Npc defenders (entityDefenderChance) now actually stop
  player missiles: one defender (70 damage) kills one missile (70 hp).
---
